// the browser signs in against and the issuer the backend validates are ONE
// declared fact, projected to both; they cannot drift into the failure this
// file's header describes (sign-in succeeds, every RPC 401s).
//
// Exposed under the same `env` name the build-time branch below uses, so
// every read site in this file is identical either way — only the SOURCE of
// the values changes. Defined as a getter-backed object rather than a plain
